[{"id":"chat_mock_1","title":"Order #12345 Support","messages":[{"id":"m1","role":"user","content":"Hi, I'm checking the status of my order #12345.","timestamp":"2024-01-10T10:00:00Z"},{"id":"m2","role":"assistant","content":"Hello! Let me check that for you... \n\nYour order **#12345** is currently **In Transit** and is expected to arrive by **Thursday, Jan 12th**.\n\n### Order Details:\n- **Item:** Premium Wireless Headphones\n- **Status:** Shipped\n- **Carrier:** Fedex","timestamp":"2024-01-10T10:00:15Z"}],"createdAt":"2024-01-10T10:00:00Z","updatedAt":"2024-01-10T10:00:15Z"},{"id":"chat_mock_2","title":"Product Comparison: Keyboards","messages":[{"id":"m3","role":"user","content":"Can you compare the Mechanical Keyboard and the basic Office Keyboard?","timestamp":"2024-01-11T14:20:00Z"},{"id":"m4","role":"assistant","content":"Certainly! Here's a quick comparison:\n\n| Feature | Mechanical Keyboard | Office Keyboard |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| **Switch Type** | Tactile Blue | Membrane |\n| **Durability** | 50M Clicks | 5M Clicks |\n| **Backlight** | RGB | None |\n| **Price** | $129.00 | $29.00 |\n\nIf you do a lot of typing or gaming, the **Mechanical Keyboard** is highly recommended for its tactile feedback and durability.","timestamp":"2024-01-11T14:20:30Z"}],"createdAt":"2024-01-11T14:20:00Z","updatedAt":"2024-01-11T14:20:30Z"},{"id":"chat_mock_3","title":"Return Policy Inquiry","messages":[{"id":"m5","role":"user","content":"What is your return policy for electronics?","timestamp":"2024-01-12T09:15:00Z"},{"id":"m6","role":"assistant","content":"Our return policy for electronics is as follows:\n\n1. **30-Day Window**: You can return any electronic item within 30 days of purchase.\n2. **Condition**: Items must be in their original packaging with all accessories.\n3. **Restocking Fee**: A 10% restocking fee applies to opened items.\n\nYou can initiate a return through your `Account Settings` or by speaking with our support team.","timestamp":"2024-01-12T09:15:20Z"}],"createdAt":"2024-01-12T09:15:00Z","updatedAt":"2024-01-12T09:15:20Z"}]